Package: tipster
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: on-screen usability tips for V\OS
 Tipster shows short, randomly picked usability tips in a small window
 - optionally on a timer - drawn from the tip collection it ships, with
 a shuffle feature and full localization (twenty-one languages).
